WEBVTT

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.800
(Creatures grunting)

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:33.960
OK, we got him.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:36.480
Now we get a meal.

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:40.096
So really, at this part of the game,

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:42.736
what we're doing is we're
running around and surviving,

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.696
and also getting to the next generation,

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:48.016
because we're going to play
through every generation of this creature.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.616
We can mate, so I'm going to see

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.200
if one of these creatures
wants to mate with me. Yeah.

00:04:56.636 --> 00:04:58.656
(Creatures grunting)

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:02.496
We didn't want to replay
actual evolution with humans and all that,